Requirement: Discover which VM has excessively used the CPU in the last 30 min
Query:
Perf
|where CounterName == "% Processor Time"
|where TimeGenerated > ago(30min)
|summarize AvgCPU = avg(CounterValue) by Computer
|sort by AvgCPU desc 

Result: Querying the average CPU time in the last 30 min to see if any VM had extensive CPU usage above 80%

Requirement: Discover which VM had the CPU overhauled in the specified time when the issue appeared
Query:
Perf
|where CounterName == "% Processor Time"
where TimeGenerated between (

datetime(2026-07-28 09:00:00Z)

..

datetime(2026-07-28 11:00:00Z)

)
|summarize AvgCPU = avg(CounterValue) by Computer

Result: See which VMs had the processor overused in the time range when the issue has occured

Requirement: Discover if there are any warning, error or critical level events 
Query:
Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30min)
| summarize TelemetryCount=count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 1min), _ResourceId
| render timechart 





Perf
|where TimeGenerated > ago(15min)
|where CounterName has "% Processor Time"
|where CounterValue > 80
|summarize avg(CounterValue) by Computer


Perf
|where TimeGenerated > ago(30min)
|where CounterName has "% Processor Time"
|where CounterValue > 80
|extend TimeFrame = bin(TimeGenerated, 5min)
|summarize AvgCPU = avg(CounterValue) by Computer, TimeFrame


Heartbeat
|where Computer in ("AppVM-1", "WebVM-1")


Perf
| where CounterName == "% Processor Time"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, CounterValue
| render timechart 


